# UE5 Sekiro Inspired Combat Demo

A short Unreal Engine 5 combat prototype built to my gameplay programming skills.

## Current Features
-Parry System (COMPLETED)
-Posture System (COMPLETED)
-Combat Animations (IN PROGRESS)
-Enemy AI (Soon to be worked on)
-Hit Reactions (Soon to be worked on)
-Lock-on system (COMPLETED)
-UI (Soon to be worked on)

## Goals
My goal is to somewhat recreate the feeling of precise combat while learning Unreal Engine 5, Blueprints, and C++.

## Built With
-Unreal Engine 5
-Blueprints
-C++

